[statement]
Packages installed and upgraded go in install order, walked from the world
and the request together, in name order: `b`, kept, leads to `lib`, so
`lib` is upgraded before `x` is installed, though `c` names `x` first.

[repository]
P:lib
V:2

P:x
V:1

P:c
V:1
D:x lib>=2

[installed]
P:lib
V:1

P:b
V:1
D:lib

[world]
b

[request]
c

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
upgrade lib 1 2
install x 1
install c 1
